                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Siege Saga is the exact opposite of the world famous angry birds, rather then trying to Attack the pig, you ARE the pig trying to hold off against catapults, ballista, cannons, and sometimes even a very fat dragon!\nI personally gave this game a 4/$4 because its worth every penny! Its a great little casual logic puzzle game, and I have seen devs ask for a LOT more money and delivered a lot less then the 100 levels promised here!\n\nI did a full video review here: https://youtu.be/iIY8Dl2Ys0Y",
